WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.360
¿Qué es este lugar?

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.200
Weren’t we going to

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.760
Aspen Corp’s office?

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.480
You were interested in the investor

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.200
who was willing to put millions

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.120
into our hotels.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.400
He lives here, and he's waiting for us.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.360
But I didn't agree to this.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.520
Why talk to him at all?

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.480
Consider this your first lesson.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.440
You spend your life

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.440
getting what you wanted.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.360
Business doesn't work like that.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:47.240
Sometimes you have to do things
that you don't want to.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.240
Whatever.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.440
Your task

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.960
is to present the renovation project

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.920
for the family mansion.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.880
And do it like you're thrilled about it.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.560
Sell him this project.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.600
If you can't,

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.920
your training ends here.
